  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Derivatives of barbituric acid viz., veronal, amytal, nembutal, luminal and seconal constitute an important class of tranquilizers. These derivatives are called barbiturates. Barbiturates are hypnotic. i.e.,&nbsp;sleep producing agents.</p><p>Amytal is hypnotic drug used to treat sleep disorder.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0019_da75e437d707.png\" style=\"width: 125px; height: 200px;\" /></p></blockquote>"
